SUMMARY:Karaoke night 
DESCRIPTION:Meet People Lancaster\nKaraoke Night! We have a table reservat
 ion under Jim Murray. We’ll also put an MPL sign on our table\, so you c
 an find it easily. Karaoke starts at 9PM\, but let’s get situated at 8:3
 0PM so we’re ready to roll at 9 when the music starts.\n\nWhen: Saturday
 \, Nov 14th\n\nAddress: 4031-B\, Columbia Ave\, Columbia\, PA 17512\n\nCos
 t: Free - everyone on their own tabs for any drink or food purchases. Plea
 se support our venue with a drink purchase and tip your server. Free parki
 ng in the lot.\n\nHosts: Jim Murray
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meet-people-lancaster/events/31735919
 4/
